     "judge_reason": "The abstract materially overstates the improvement range: it claims every IC-conditioned encoder is 4–16× more accurate than any coefficient-only surrogate. Against the submitted IC-blind coefficient-only control, the unseen-family improvement is only 3.212× for LiftSpec and 2.470× for the dual encoder. Neither rounds to 4×. The calculation producing 4–16× uses a narrower set of encoders and only the healthy reference-baseline seeds. This finding concerns the reported comparison, not fabrication of the underlying runs.",
