      "proposal/code/extra_core_macros.py:87–108 calculates the range for naive/factorized/spectral/lift against healthy coef_ref seeds, excluding coef_blind and dual.",
      "proposal/sections/table_main.tex:12–17 accurately reports the underlying control and encoder errors; those values also reproduce from the five per-seed result files."
